  {
   "eventName": "History",
   "image": "/media/dd740b_c7402f3668714e96a33b791e54e9ca20.jpg",
   "description": "First minister of the congregation Charisma, established Oct 29 1972. Earlier, on the 4th of Oct 1967, the first place of worship was dedicated at 27th Ivor Street, Laudium. On the 29th of Apr 1971 the present church complex was inaugurated. On returning to Charisma, the Charisma Evangelism Council was formed on Sept 21 1996 and the vision Laudium a mission field was born and Chapel Hill was developed. On the 1st of Aug 1997 the Church assisted in the establishment of Excel to help meet the para-medical needs of the people.",
   "_id": "5983ef4b-05dc-4737-91c8-118d7a816662",
   "_createdDate": {
    "$date": "2026-09-16T21:16:31.237Z"
   },
