   "description": "First missionary to the Indian people as minister to the Northern Transvaal region. He was stationed as pastor on the 16th of April 1965 he baptised sister Angeline Naidoo, the first member of the Transvaal congregation of the Indian Reformed Church in the Pretoria region.",
