  },
  {
   "eventName": "History",
   "image": "/media/dd740b_6af4ad7ef33d466da9b423b5b318d61e.jpg",
   "description": "First missionary of the Dutch Reformed Church called to reach out to the Indian people of Transvaal. He gave guidance and assistance to the DRC Youth who reached out to the people of Prinsloo Street and Marabastad in Pretoria since 10 June 1956. He was stationed in Johannesburg and initiated the official mission work in Pretoria.",
