   "description": "During his ministry in Charisma the RCA Synod met for its fourth yearly meeting in Laudium 2-7 October 1990. At this time the first Hymnbook, Hymns and Spiritual Songs, was officially adopted for use in the RCA. At the same event the Laudium Declaration, signifying the evangelical thrust of the RCA, was unanimously adopted by the church.",
